<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00186/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一台电视，当两名观看者观看电视时，其中一名观看者会有强烈的调至新闻频道，而另一名会想要调至体育频道。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>20██/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>一家位于██的家电商店中发现，同批次物品无异常。<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>被收容于Site-CN-24的低价值物品收容柜<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong>Storeshoes你都已经看了这么久的新闻了，让我看一会体育。——Dr.Frank<br />
还我调控器，我还没看完新闻呢。——Dr.Storeshoes</p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00186" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00186" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00186-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/storeshoes" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6056485); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6056485&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1610094460" alt="storeshoes" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6056485)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/storeshoes" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6056485); return false;">storeshoes</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1589246054 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">12 May 2020 01:14</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00398/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一支原产于比利时的FN FNC突击步枪，只有在弹匣井内插有巧克力块时才能射出子弹。若插入正常弹匣，则项目只会射出5.56×45mm子弹形状的巧克力。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>20██/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>武警部队特种警察大队██仓库<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>收容于Site-CN-██异常武器收容单元<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong><em>射出的巧克力吃起来特别甜。</em>——Dr. Kleiner</p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00398" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00398" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00398-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/kayo-kesr-aquas" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5232386); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5232386&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1610094460" alt="Kayo_Kesr_Aquas" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5232386)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/kayo-kesr-aquas" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5232386); return false;">Kayo_Kesr_Aquas</a></span></p>
